message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "hawkes-engine"
abstract: >-
  Multivariate Hawkes processes with exponential kernels for Python: a compiled
  likelihood and gradient, a maximum-likelihood fit with standard errors, two
  independent exact simulators, time-rescaling diagnostics, and a lookup of what a
  pre-registered simulation study measured about the fit's standard errors.
type: software
version: 0.1.0.dev0
authors:
  - family-names: Cheung
    given-names: Freddy Shi Chun
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/freddysccheung-067/hawkes-engine"
url: "https://freddysccheung-067.github.io/hawkes-engine/"
keywords:
  - Hawkes process
  - point process
  - maximum likelihood
  - time rescaling
